    {
      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "Health phrases need to be simple because the other person may need to act quickly or ask a follow-up. For \"I have a headache\", Tôi bị đau đầu makes the next step easier to answer. Point to the affected area or show the medicine name if that makes the need clearer.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
